title: door_blocked_metal_wont_move
---
A metal door. It doesn't seem to move.
===

title: door_blocked_wood_latch_cabin
---
Wooden door with a conventional latch.

It has a light blue sign with a tower symbol, next to the cabin number.
===

title: door_blocked_wood_latch_cabin_tampered
---
Wooden door with a conventional latch. It looks like it has been tampered with.

It has a light blue sign with a tower symbol, next to the cabin number.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_deck_c_balcony_a
---
Metal door with a round bolt and a crank.

The door connects Deck C to Balcony A. It has a yellow sign with a sun symbol.
===

title: door_blocked_sliding_consultorio_a
---
Metal sliding door painted white.

It has a white sign that reads "Clinic A", with a moon symbol next to it.
===

title: door_blocked_sliding_double_destino
---
A large double sliding door. It has several bloodstains and some dents.

It has a white sign that reads "Destination", next to a moon symbol.
===

title: door_blocked_sliding_consultorio_b
---
Metal sliding door painted white.

It has a white sign that reads "Clinic B", with a moon symbol next to it.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_barred_window
---
Metal door with a barred window. There are bloodstains on it.

There's a mark where a sign once labeled the room.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_deck_c_balcony_b
---
Metal door with a round bolt and a crank.

The door connects Deck C to Balcony B. It has a yellow sign with a sun symbol.
