title: door_blocked_metal_deck_b_balcony_b
---
Metal door with a round bolt and a crank.

The door connects Deck B to Balcony B. It has a yellow sign with a sun symbol.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_bathrooms
---
Metal door. The knob looks battered, as if someone tried to force it.

It has a red sign that reads "Bathrooms", next to a star.
===

title: door_blocked_wood_cabin
---
Wooden door.

It has a light blue sign with a tower symbol, next to the cabin number.
