title: door_blocked_laundry
---
It has a red sign that reads "Laundry", with a dog symbol next to it.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_maintenance
---
Rather sturdy metal door. There are bloodstains on it.

It has a red sign that reads "Maintenance Office", next to a star.
