title: door_blocked_metal_double_portholes_kitchen
---
A double metal door with 2 circular windows.

FROM PORT: It seems to be locked from the other side. A kitchen can be made out through the window.
FROM STARBOARD: Unlocks the door.
===

title: door_blocked_metal_lift_dark
---
Metal lift door. It has a large window, but nothing can be seen since it's dark on the other side.
